  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{買|か}う (buy X).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates resulting state or repeated action. {買|か}っている = 'have bought' or 'buy regularly.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{本|ほん}→本：00111_hon⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{買|か}う (buy a book)\n- 〜⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{買|か}う (buy at ~)\n- ⟦{買|か}い{物|もの}→買い物：00853_kaimono⟧ (shopping - noun)\n- ⟦{買|か}い{物|もの}→買い物：00853_kaimono⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{行|い}く→行く：00119_iku⟧ (go shopping)\n\nOpposite: ⟦{売|う}る→売る：00906_uru⟧ (to sell).",
